name
ofType {
kind
name
ofType {
kind
name
ofType {
kind
name
ofType {
kind
name
ofType {
kind
name
ofType {

kind
name
ofType {
kind
name
}
}
}
}
}
}
}
}
The result will usually be very long (and hence has been shortened here), and it will contain the entire schema of the
GraphQL deployment.
